blkid crashes on the attached file:

$ /sbin/blkid crash.blk
Segmentation fault


Valgrind says it's a buffer over-read:

==1134== Invalid read of size 1
==1134==    at 0x4075FEC: crc64 (crc64.c:102)
==1134==    by 0x40675A1: bcache_crc64 (bcache.c:98)
